    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43853" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐερκ-ής</span></b>  (Cret.<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐερκής</span></b> 
