			<u>Hymn.Curet.</u>
			10
		</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕρκος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>well-fenced,
				well-walled</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.472
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				21.389
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Pae.</u>
					4.45
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>O.</u>
					13.109
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					955
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρόπολις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					15.11.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα εὐ. πρὸς τοὺς πολεμίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					760e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδοχή</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				848e
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έσταται πράξεις ὡσανεὶ πόλεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.681
				</span></i>
			; <i>secure</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύραι δ᾽ εὐερκέες εἰσί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.267
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐεργέες</span>
			). Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.503c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>girding in, surrounding</i>, of nets, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
